// VISUAILS — the homepage, rebuilt on the espresso ground. Section 17.
//
// WHY A NEW FILE RATHER THAN A REWRITE OF HomePage.astro. The old file is 81 kB
// of markup with four sections' worth of argued decisions embedded in its
// comments, and its copy is priced, bilingual and evidence-checked. Rebuilding
// in place would have meant editing all of that at once, with no way back and
// no way to compare. This file composes from the section primitives in
// global.css instead, borrows the copy lines that were already right, and is
// switched on by one import in src/pages/index.astro. The old page stays as
// reference until the rebuild is finished across the site; rolling back is one
// line, which is the only reason it is safe to move this fast.
//
// THE LANE, named before anything was drawn, because the register reference is
// explicit that unnamed ambition becomes beige: a colour proof on a press-room
// table under low light. Registration marks, exact figures, a dark room in
// which the photographs are the only lit objects. Not "dark SaaS" — the tell
// for that would be three equal feature cards with icons, a gradient hero and a
// badge row, which is the modal page in this category and the one this brand
// exists to be the opposite of.
//
// The rhythm is onlinepaymentplatform.com's, at Lucas's direction: full-bleed
// bands, one idea per fold, a centred statement before any explanation, tiles
// of unequal weight, a rail you push sideways, a closing panel that takes the
// viewport. The geometry is not theirs — OPP is pills and 24px radii, this
// system has no radius at all.
